  "Not syncing: this plugin version is too old (needs {version} or newer). Click to update.": "Kh\xF4ng \u0111\u1ED3ng b\u1ED9 h\xF3a: phi\xEAn b\u1EA3n plugin n\xE0y qu\xE1 c\u0169 (c\u1EA7n {version} tr\u1EDF l\xEAn). Nh\u1EA5p \u0111\u1EC3 c\u1EADp nh\u1EADt.",
  "Not syncing: this plugin version is too old. Click to update.": "Kh\xF4ng \u0111\u1ED3ng b\u1ED9 h\xF3a: phi\xEAn b\u1EA3n plugin n\xE0y qu\xE1 c\u0169. Nh\u1EA5p \u0111\u1EC3 c\u1EADp nh\u1EADt.",
  "Note couldn't be processed": "Kh\xF4ng th\u1EC3 x\u1EED l\xFD ghi ch\xFA",
  "Note limit reached. Upgrade to keep adding notes.": "\u0110\xE3 \u0111\u1EA1t gi\u1EDBi h\u1EA1n ghi ch\xFA. N\xE2ng c\u1EA5p \u0111\u1EC3 th\xEAm nhi\u1EC1u ghi ch\xFA h\u01A1n.",
  "Note not synced locally": "Ghi ch\xFA ch\u01B0a \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c \u0111\u1ED3ng b\u1ED9 h\xF3a c\u1EE5c b\u1ED9",
  "Notes on this device": "Ghi ch\xFA tr\xEAn thi\u1EBFt b\u1ECB n\xE0y",
  "Notes past this still sync and open normally, they are just not in the search index. The index keeps your oldest notes, so it is your newest ones that fall outside.": "C\xE1c ghi ch\xFA sau \u0111\xE2y v\u1EABn \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c \u0111\u1ED3ng b\u1ED9 h\xF3a v\xE0 m\u1EDF b\xECnh th\u01B0\u1EDDng, ch\xFAng ch\u1EC9 kh\xF4ng n\u1EB1m trong ch\u1EC9 m\u1EE5c t\xECm ki\u1EBFm. Ch\u1EC9 m\u1EE5c l\u01B0u tr\u1EEF c\xE1c ghi ch\xFA c\u0169 nh\u1EA5t c\u1EE7a b\u1EA1n, v\xEC v\u1EADy c\xE1c ghi ch\xFA m\u1EDBi nh\u1EA5t c\u1EE7a b\u1EA1n s\u1EBD kh\xF4ng n\u1EB1m trong \u0111\xF3.",
  "Notes searchable": "Ghi ch\xFA c\xF3 th\u1EC3 t\xECm ki\u1EBFm",
  "Notes stored": "Ghi ch\xFA \u0111\xE3 \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c l\u01B0u tr\u1EEF",
  "Nothing in this vault syncs until you choose how to merge it with the server.": "Kh\xF4ng c\xF3 g\xEC trong kho l\u01B0u tr\u1EEF n\xE0y \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c \u0111\u1ED3ng b\u1ED9 h\xF3a cho \u0111\u1EBFn khi b\u1EA1n ch\u1ECDn c\xE1ch h\u1EE3p nh\u1EA5t n\xF3 v\u1EDBi m\xE1y ch\u1EE7.",
  "Nothing is deleted.": "Kh\xF4ng c\xF3 g\xEC b\u1ECB x\xF3a.",
  "Nothing needs your attention. \u{1F389}": "Kh\xF4ng c\xF3 g\xEC c\u1EA7n b\u1EA1n quan t\xE2m. \u{1F389}",
  "Nothing to sync yet \u2014 this vault is empty on both sides. Start syncing and everything you write appears on your other devices.": "Hi\u1EC7n t\u1EA1i ch\u01B0a c\xF3 g\xEC \u0111\u1EC3 \u0111\u1ED3ng b\u1ED9 h\xF3a \u2014 kho l\u01B0u tr\u1EEF n\xE0y tr\u1ED1ng \u1EDF c\u1EA3 hai ph\xEDa. B\u1EAFt \u0111\u1EA7u \u0111\u1ED3ng b\u1ED9 h\xF3a v\xE0 m\u1ECDi th\u1EE9 b\u1EA1n vi\u1EBFt s\u1EBD xu\u1EA5t hi\u1EC7n tr\xEAn c\xE1c thi\u1EBFt b\u1ECB kh\xE1c c\u1EE7a b\u1EA1n.",
  "Nothing to sync yet: every file here is on your ignore list. Start syncing and everything you write appears on your other devices.": "Ch\u01B0a c\xF3 g\xEC \u0111\u1EC3 \u0111\u1ED3ng b\u1ED9 h\xF3a: m\u1ECDi t\u1EC7p \u1EDF \u0111\xE2y \u0111\u1EC1u n\u1EB1m trong danh s\xE1ch b\u1ECF qua c\u1EE7a b\u1EA1n. B\u1EAFt \u0111\u1EA7u \u0111\u1ED3ng b\u1ED9 h\xF3a v\xE0 m\u1ECDi th\u1EE9 b\u1EA1n vi\u1EBFt s\u1EBD hi\u1EC3n th\u1ECB tr\xEAn c\xE1c thi\u1EBFt b\u1ECB kh\xE1c.",
  "Nothing will be deleted.": "Kh\xF4ng c\xF3 g\xEC s\u1EBD b\u1ECB x\xF3a.",
  "Nothing will be removed from this device.": "Kh\xF4ng c\xF3 g\xEC s\u1EBD b\u1ECB x\xF3a kh\u1ECFi thi\u1EBFt b\u1ECB n\xE0y.",
