  "Pick a vault (previous: id {id} not found)": "Ch\u1ECDn m\u1ED9t kho l\u01B0u tr\u1EEF (tr\u01B0\u1EDBc \u0111\xF3: id {id} kh\xF4ng t\xECm th\u1EA5y)",
