  "Pull all (delete extras) aborted: could not obtain an exclusive server snapshot (replay contention). Nothing was trashed.": "B\u1ECF qua thao t\xE1c k\xE9o t\u1EA5t c\u1EA3 (x\xF3a d\u1EEF li\u1EC7u th\u1EEBa): kh\xF4ng th\u1EC3 l\u1EA5y b\u1EA3n ch\u1EE5p nhanh \u0111\u1ED9c quy\u1EC1n c\u1EE7a m\xE1y ch\u1EE7 (xung \u0111\u1ED9t). Kh\xF4ng c\xF3 g\xEC b\u1ECB x\xF3a.",
