  Vault: "Kho l\u01B0u tr\u1EEF",
  "Vault ID: {id}": "ID kho l\u01B0u tr\u1EEF: {id}",
  "Vault limit reached. Upgrade for more vaults.": "\u0110\xE3 \u0111\u1EA1t gi\u1EDBi h\u1EA1n kho l\u01B0u tr\u1EEF. N\xE2ng c\u1EA5p \u0111\u1EC3 c\xF3 th\xEAm kho l\u01B0u tr\u1EEF.",
  "Vault name": "T\xEAn kho l\u01B0u tr\u1EEF",
  "Vault selection": "Ch\u1ECDn kho l\u01B0u tr\u1EEF",
  "Vendored dependencies": "C\xE1c th\u01B0 vi\u1EC7n \u0111i k\xE8m",
  "Version: {version}": "Phi\xEAn b\u1EA3n: {version}",
  "Waiting for authorization \u2014 connected, this will complete instantly.": "\u0110ang ch\u1EDD x\xE1c th\u1EF1c \u2014 \u0111\xE3 k\u1EBFt n\u1ED1i, qu\xE1 tr\xECnh n\xE0y s\u1EBD ho\xE0n t\u1EA5t ngay l\u1EADp t\u1EE9c.",
  "Waiting for authorization \u2014 no live connection, checking every 30s.": "\u0110ang ch\u1EDD x\xE1c th\u1EF1c \u2014 kh\xF4ng c\xF3 k\u1EBFt n\u1ED1i tr\u1EF1c ti\u1EBFp, ki\u1EC3m tra m\u1ED7i 30 gi\xE2y.",
  "Warnings and errors": "C\u1EA3nh b\xE1o v\xE0 l\u1ED7i",
  "WebSocket connected \u2014 live sync active": "WebSocket \u0111\xE3 k\u1EBFt n\u1ED1i \u2014 \u0111\u1ED3ng b\u1ED9 h\xF3a tr\u1EF1c ti\u1EBFp \u0111ang ho\u1EA1t \u0111\u1ED9ng",
  "What Engram does, and how to connect your vault, start to finish.": "Engram ho\u1EA1t \u0111\u1ED9ng nh\u01B0 th\u1EBF n\xE0o v\xE0 c\xE1ch k\u1EBFt n\u1ED1i kho l\u01B0u tr\u1EEF c\u1EE7a b\u1EA1n, t\u1EEB \u0111\u1EA7u \u0111\u1EBFn cu\u1ED1i.",
  "What kind of feedback?": "Lo\u1EA1i ph\u1EA3n h\u1ED3i n\xE0o?",
  "What's working, what's frustrating, what do you wish Engram did?": "\u0110i\u1EC1u g\xEC \u0111ang ho\u1EA1t \u0111\u1ED9ng, \u0111i\u1EC1u g\xEC g\xE2y kh\xF3 ch\u1ECBu, b\u1EA1n mong mu\u1ED1n Engram l\xE0m g\xEC?",
  "Where this vault syncs to. Each backend keeps its own sign-in.": "N\u01A1i kho l\u01B0u tr\u1EEF n\xE0y \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c \u0111\u1ED3ng b\u1ED9 h\xF3a. M\u1ED7i backend c\xF3 ph\u01B0\u01A1ng th\u1EE9c \u0111\u0103ng nh\u1EADp ri\xEAng.",
  "Will download {count} files.": "S\u1EBD t\u1EA3i xu\u1ED1ng {count} t\u1EC7p.",
  "Will upload {count} files.": "S\u1EBD t\u1EA3i l\xEAn {count} t\u1EC7p.",
  "You are about to:": "B\u1EA1n s\u1EAFp:",
  "You are now pointing at a different cloud vault": "B\u1EA1n \u0111ang tr\u1ECF \u0111\u1EBFn m\u1ED9t kho l\u01B0u tr\u1EEF \u0111\xE1m m\xE2y kh\xE1c",
  "You can close this and the sync keeps running in the background.": "B\u1EA1n c\xF3 th\u1EC3 \u0111\xF3ng c\u1EEDa v\xE0 qu\xE1 tr\xECnh \u0111\u1ED3ng b\u1ED9 h\xF3a v\u1EABn ti\u1EBFp t\u1EE5c ch\u1EA1y trong n\u1EC1n.",
  "You've used all the attachment storage on your plan. Upgrade for more.": "B\u1EA1n \u0111\xE3 s\u1EED d\u1EE5ng h\u1EBFt dung l\u01B0\u1EE3ng l\u01B0u tr\u1EEF t\u1EC7p \u0111\xEDnh k\xE8m trong g\xF3i c\u1EE7a b\u1EA1n. N\xE2ng c\u1EA5p \u0111\u1EC3 c\xF3 th\xEAm dung l\u01B0\u1EE3ng.",
  "Your code:": "M\xE3 c\u1EE7a b\u1EA1n:",
  "Your feedback": "Ph\u1EA3n h\u1ED3i c\u1EE7a b\u1EA1n",
  "Your login expired. Sign in again in Engram settings to continue.": "Phi\xEAn \u0111\u0103ng nh\u1EADp c\u1EE7a b\u1EA1n \u0111\xE3 h\u1EBFt h\u1EA1n. \u0110\u0103ng nh\u1EADp l\u1EA1i trong ph\u1EA7n c\xE0i \u0111\u1EB7t Engram \u0111\u1EC3 ti\u1EBFp t\u1EE5c.",
  "Your plan's file limit is {limit}. Compress or split the file, then it will sync.": "Gi\u1EDBi h\u1EA1n dung l\u01B0\u1EE3ng t\u1EC7p c\u1EE7a g\xF3i c\u1EE7a b\u1EA1n l\xE0 {limit}. N\xE9n ho\u1EB7c chia nh\u1ECF t\u1EC7p, sau \u0111\xF3 n\xF3 s\u1EBD \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c \u0111\u1ED3ng b\u1ED9 h\xF3a.",
  "Your vault shares {percent} of its data with Engram": "Kho l\u01B0u tr\u1EEF c\u1EE7a b\u1EA1n chia s\u1EBB {percent} d\u1EEF li\u1EC7u v\u1EDBi Engram",
  attachments: "t\u1EC7p \u0111\xEDnh k\xE8m",
  exact: "ch\xEDnh x\xE1c",
  files: "t\u1EC7p",
  folders: "th\u01B0 m\u1EE5c",
  "match strength: {pct}%": "\u0111\u1ED9 ch\xEDnh x\xE1c: {pct}%",
  "matches meaning. Finds notes that never use the words you typed.": "kh\u1EDBp v\u1EDBi \xFD ngh\u0129a. T\xECm ghi ch\xFA kh\xF4ng s\u1EED d\u1EE5ng c\xE1c t\u1EEB b\u1EA1n nh\u1EADp.",
  "matches words and meaning together, plus this device. Widest results.": "kh\u1EDBp v\u1EDBi c\u1EA3 t\u1EEB v\xE0 \xFD ngh\u0129a, c\u1ED9ng v\u1EDBi thi\u1EBFt b\u1ECB n\xE0y. K\u1EBFt qu\u1EA3 r\u1ED9ng nh\u1EA5t.",
  "matches your words and their other forms \u2014 'run' finds 'running' \u2014 plus this device.": "kh\u1EDBp v\u1EDBi t\u1EEB c\u1EE7a b\u1EA1n v\xE0 c\xE1c d\u1EA1ng kh\xE1c \u2014 'run' t\xECm 'running' \u2014 c\u1ED9ng v\u1EDBi thi\u1EBFt b\u1ECB n\xE0y.",
  meaning: "ngh\u0129a",
